---
title: Pea Pasta
source: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vKHSrH975uw
cuisine: Italian
author: Adam Ragusea
---

== Breadcrumbs

Melt @butter{1 tbsp} in a #saucepan{} over medium heat. Add @bread crumbs{1/4 cup} and cook until browned. Set aside.

== Sauce

Combine @heavy cream{1/2 cup} and @lemon zest{}, and enough @lemon juice{} to curdle the cream until thickened.

To the cream mixture, add peeled @garlic{1 clove}, thawed @frozen peas{1 cup}, @parmesan{1/4 cup}, @fresh basil{}, and @mint{}. Blend until smooth. Add @salt{} and @black pepper{} to taste. Add the remaining thawed @frozen peas{1/2 cup} and stir to combine.

== Pasta

Boil @pasta{1/2 pound} in salted water until al dente. Drain, reserving some pasta water, and return to the pot. Add the sauce and stir to combine, loosening with reserved pasta water as needed. Serve topped with the browned breadcrumbs and additional @parmesan{} if desired.
